  "csqtt 2.5 has no devices: the tunnel address belongs to the password, and one password serves one device at a time. Its keys come from a DTLS handshake with the server; if the server answers none, from the password alone — and then, as with 2.1.9, traffic recorded today can be decrypted by anyone who learns the password later.": [
    "ServerEditView.swift"
